# Output files to optionally ignore (customize as needed)
# *.html  # Uncomment if you don't want to track HTML files
# *.pdf   # Uncomment if you don't want to track PDF files

# Data files (customize based on your needs)
# *.csv   # Uncomment if you don't want to track CSV files
# *.xlsx  # Uncomment if you don't want to track Excel files

